<title>USA: Canon-McMillan SD, Pa., adjusted NIC.</title>
<headline>Canon-McMillan SD, Pa., adjusted NIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canon-McMillan School District, Pa., said Wednesday it recalculated Mellon Bank's winning bid on the District's $5 million general bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the net interest cost was 5.3965 percent reflecting the cost of bond insurance, not the true interest cost of 5.372 percent originally calculated.</p>
